\v 1 \add ≈So\add* Yahweh¦146956 sent¦146955 Natan¦146959 to David¦146962 \add ≈to tell\add* him¦146964, “\add Once\add* \add ≈there was¦146973 a rich¦146973 man and¦146974 a poor¦146975 man living in¦146970 the same city¦146970\add*.\x + \xo 12:1: \xt Psa 51 header.\x*
