\p
\v 12 “No¦147818, my¦147820 brother¦147820,” she¦147816 told him¦147817, “don't humiliate me¦147823 because¦147824 \add ≈we Israelis¦147829 don't do that¦147836\add*. Don't¦147821 do this¦147836 disgraceful¦147835 thing¦147835.
