\v 16 “No¦147893, \add no\add*.” she¦147891 responded¦147891. “\add ≈Sending me away¦147904 would be even worse than¦147899 what you¦147902 just¦147898\add* did¦147902 to¦147904 me.”
\p \add ≈But¦147891\add* he¦147906 refused to listen¦147907 to her¦147908
\v 17 and called¦147910 his¦147914 \add ≈personal servant\add*. He¦147915 told him¦147914 to¦147923 \add ≈take\add* the woman away¦147916 and send¦147916 her outside¦147923 and then¦147910 lock¦147924 the door¦147925 behind¦147926 her.
