\p \add ≈So¦147928 the servant¦147941 pushed\add* her outside¦147942 and¦147928 locked¦147943 the door¦147944 behind¦147945 her.
\v 19 Then¦147947 Tamar¦147948 put ashes on her head and tore¦147957 the¦147953 long¦147953 robe¦147953 that¦147955 she was wearing. She¦147958 put her hand¦147959 on her head and wailed as she walked \add home\add*.\f + \fr 13:19 \ft The ashes, tearing of clothes, putting hand on head, and wailing, were all cultural signs of mourning and distress.\f*
