\v 30 \add ≈While¦148197 they¦148187 were still on¦148188 the way¦148188\add*, David¦148193 heard the news¦148189 that Abshalom¦148196 had¦148195 struck¦148195 all¦148199 of¦148199 his sons¦148201 and killed them¦148206, and none were left¦148205 alive.
