\v 11 “Please¦148598,” she¦148595 \add ≈insisted\add*, “may the king¦148599 \add ≈ask\add* your¦148603 god¦148603 Yahweh¦148602 to¦148623 prevent the avenger¦148606 of¦148606 blood¦148607 from¦148604 increasing¦148604 the \add ≈tragedy\add*, so my¦148613 son¦148613 won't¦148609 be destroyed¦148610.”
\p “As surely as Yahweh lives,” he¦148614 \add ≈vowed\add*, “not¦148609 a hair from your son's¦148622 head will¦148620 fall¦148620 to the¦148599 ground¦148623.”
\p
\v 12 Then¦148625 the woman¦148626 said¦148625, “Please¦148629, let¦148627 your¦148630 female servant¦148630 \add ≈ask\add* my¦148633 master¦148633 the king¦148634 \add ≈a question\add*.”
\p “Speak¦148637,” he¦148636 \add ≈replied¦148625\add*.
