\v 6 By loving those who hate you and hating those who love you, you've¦151866 \add effectively\add* declared today that your¦151873 officers and men \add ≈mean\add* nothing to you. \add It seems to us that\add* if Abshalom was still alive today and we were all dead, then it¦151865 \add ≈would have¦151866 all been okay to you\add*.
