\v 24 Then Shaul's \add ≈grandson\add* Mefiboshet came down to¦152331 meet the king. He¦152336 hadn't \add ≈shaved\add* or \add ≈washed\add* his feet, and¦152336 he¦152336 hadn't washed his clothes \add ≈since the king had left Yerushalem\add*.\x + \xo 19:24: \xt 2Sam 9:1-13; 16:1-4.\x*
