\v 4 “\add ≈We have no claim\add* to gold¦153487 or silver¦153486 from Sha'ul¦153490 or his¦153493 household¦153493,” the¦153481 Gibeonites \add ≈replied¦153479\add*, “And¦153487 \add ≈we¦153484 don't¦153482 wish to have anyone\add* in¦153499 Yisrael¦153499 put¦153498 to death¦153498.”
