\v 10 \add ≈However, David¦155211 had a guilty conscience\add* after¦155213 he'd had the people¦155219 counted¦155216 and¦155208 he told Yahweh, “I've \add ≈disobeyed you badly, but¦155208\add* now¦155230, Yahweh, please¦155234 \add ≈take¦155232 away¦155232\add* the iniquity¦155237 of¦155237 your servant¦155238 because¦155239 I've been very foolish¦155240.”
